{"id":"647592","name":"柠檬鸡","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/647592/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"柠檬","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡肉洗净擦干水份。","img":"images/647592/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡肉加入姜片，少许盐涂抹均匀静置备用。","img":"images/647592/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎备用。","img":"images/647592/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将鸡肉上锅，大火煮开蒸20分钟，左右。","img":"images/647592/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒸好的鸡肉放入冰水冷却。","img":"images/647592/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"柠檬用盐搓洗后切薄片去籽备用。","img":"images/647592/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"青瓜洗净轻拍几下后切块备用。","img":"images/647592/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香菜洗净切段备用。","img":"images/647592/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鸡肉改刀斩块。","img":"images/647592/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"碗中放入鸡肉，挤上柠檬汁。","img":"images/647592/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入蒜末和柠檬。","img":"images/647592/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入青瓜。","img":"images/647592/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入香菜。","img":"images/647592/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入适量生抽，蚝油，陈醋。","img":"images/647592/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入适量盐和花生油。","img":"images/647592/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"翻拌均匀腌制数小时入味。","img":"images/647592/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/647592/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/647592/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/647592/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}